## Environment

Copy `.env.example` to `.env`. Optional `API_KEY` is sent as `Authorization: Bearer`
on TVMaze requests when set (`vite.config.ts` exposes `API_` prefix).

## AI tooling

Cursor rules in `.cursor/rules/` and hooks in `.cursor/hooks/` mirror the setup from
`password.manager`, adapted for this single-app frontend repo. Quality gates are
defined in `.cursor/rules/quality-gating.mdc`. Plan every UI change for web and
mobile per `.cursor/rules/design-ux.mdc` before implementing.

## Routes

| Path | Page | Module | Query params |
| ---- | ---- | ------ | ------------ |
| `/` | Shows | `shows` | `q` (search), `status` (Running / Ended / To Be Determined) |
| `/shows/:showId` | Show detail | `show-detail` | — |
| `/favorites` | My List | `favorites` | — |
| `*` | Not found | `common` | — |

Add new routes in `src/routes/index.tsx` and create matching modules under `src/modules/`.
